    "%%writefile train.py\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "train.py -- multi-label offense-category classifier on mugshots (fast pipeline).\n",
    "\n",
    "  single GPU : python train.py --backbone convnext_tiny.fb_in22k_ft_in1k ...\n",
    "  both T4s   : torchrun --standalone --nproc_per_node=2 train.py --backbone ... \n",
    "\n",
    "Speed design\n",
    "  * images come from a pre-resized uint8 .npy memmap (build_cache.py) -> no JPEG decode in the loop\n",
    "  * one background thread gathers a batch from the memmap into pinned memory; the GPU does the rest\n",
    "  * ALL augmentation (affine/flip/zoom, brightness/contrast, grayscale, erasing, mixup) runs on the GPU\n",
    "  * DDP over both T4s, channels_last, fp16 autocast\n",
    "Accuracy design\n",
    "  * 80/10/10 split: select on val, REPORT on test (baseline selected and reported on the same 10%)\n",
    "  * EMA weights, layer-wise LR decay, cosine+warmup per step, label smoothing, drop-path, light head\n",
