    "Heatmaps can look convincing and still be unfaithful, so each one is paired with a test:\n",
    "* **Face detections** (`detections.png`): Haar face boxes on the cached images. *Look at this sheet first*; the face-box numbers are only as good as these boxes (the cache is squashed to a square, which can hurt detection).\n",
